{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2021-10-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'INVESCO LAUNCHES DIGITAL ASSETS AND BLOCKCHAIN THEMATIC EQUITY ETFS IN THE U.S.', 'text': 'ATLANTA, OCT. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- INVESCO LTD. (NYSE: IVZ), A LEADING GLOBAL ASSET MANAGEMENT FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF TWO PASSIVELY MANAGED EXCHANGE-TRADED FUNDS (ETFS) FOCUSED ON DIGITAL ASSETS AND BLOCKCHAIN.'}